~ start
Narrator: The village burns.
- Help the villagers
	do Bridge.change_morale(1)
	do Bridge.set_flag("helped")
	=> after
- Walk away
	do Bridge.set_flag("ignored_flag")
	=> after
- Hesitate
	=> pause
- Look for a secret [if Bridge.check_flag("never_set")]
	=> nowhere

~ pause
Narrator: You wait.
=> after

~ after
Narrator: Dawn.
=> END

~ orphan
Narrator: Nobody reaches this.
=> END
